      "id": "claim_5eb03703d4644f32a189ea1538c9a67a",
      "statement": "OpenRouter server tools (openrouter:web_search, openrouter:web_fetch) execute entirely server-side inside a single chat/completions HTTP request — grok-cli attaches a tools array and reads back the final assistant message, url_citation annotations, and usage.server_tool_use counts; there is no client-side tool loop.",
