      "statement": "resolveWebOptions computes searchEnabled = modeAllowsWeb(mode) && (mode === 'retrieve' ? true : config.web.search.enabled) && !cli.noWeb, so retrieve mode forces search on even when config disables it, --no-web is the only escape hatch, and deepresearch/multi always resolve to search disabled regardless of config or flags; fetchEnabled = searchEnabled && (config.web.fetch.enabled || fetchFlag), so fetch is never forced in retrieve mode.",
      "evidence": [
